  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed new page brushes by @DirkKramer in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/518\n* Removes LeftDrawerExpandThresholdWidth to prevent auto opening ignoring the IsOpened by @DirkKramer in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/519\n* Implement a basic CalendarDatePicker mimicking other pickers by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/521\n* Rework MenuItem and Menu themes to better match the m2 guidelines by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/524\n* Fix snackbar attaching exception in the previewer by @SKProCH in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/525\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/compare/v3.17.0...v3.18.0",
